            class="cs-seg cs-seg--1"
            style="--w:32.24%"><i>Seven weeks</i></span
          ><span class="cs-seg cs-seg--2" style="--w:13.82%"><i>Three weeks</i></span><span
            class="cs-seg cs-seg--3"
            style="--w:26.32%"><i>The rest</i></span
          ><span class="cs-mk" style="--x:32.89%"><b>Month two</b>The eventual hire is turned down</span>
        </div>
      </div>
