      </li><li><b class="cs-key cs-seg--3"></b><span><strong>The rest</strong> of the five months</span></li>
    </ul>
    <ol class="cs-steps">
      <li><span class="cs-d">Day 1</span><h3>Forty-five minutes with the hiring manager, alone.</h3></li>
      <li style="--d:60ms"><span class="cs-d">Day 2</span><h3>Six skills, weighted, written down and agreed.</h3></li>
      <li style="--d:120ms">
        <span class="cs-d">Next</span><h3>
